---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ArrowCalculator from '../components/ArrowCalculator';


import AdsterraBanner from '../components/AdsterraBanner.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Stand Out Stand Rarity & Drop Rates – Verified Official Chances | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Verified drop rates and rarity chances for Roblox STAND OUT. View exact percentages for Mysterious, Lucky, Bizarre, and Focus Arrows with our interactive odds calculator."
  canonicalPath="stand-rarity"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Stand Rarity & Rates' }]}
  schemaType="CollectionPage"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold mb-3 border border-amber-200">
        <span>Official Studio Umbra Data</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Mathematical Odds Analysis</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Stand Rarity &amp; Drop Rates
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Understanding arrow drop rates in Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong> is critical before spending valuable Dalas or crafting components. Below is the verified mathematical breakdown of rarity tiers across all arrow variants.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Top Above-The-Fold Adsterra Native Banner -->
    <AdsterraBanner className="mb-10" />

    <!-- Rate Comparison Table -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden mb-14">
      <div class="p-6 border-b border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Official Arrow Rarity Rate Table</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Verified against developer cards on the official release Trello.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <th class="py-3 px-4">Rarity Tier</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4">Mysterious Arrow</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4">Lucky Arrow</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4">Bizarre Arrow</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4">Focus Arrows (P3/P5)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700">
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/70">
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> Rare
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Possible (~45.0%)</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-rose-600">Excluded (0%)</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-rose-600">Excluded (0%)</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Filtered to specific Part</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/70">
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500"></span> Epic
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Possible (~35.0%)</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">42.5%</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-rose-600">Excluded (0%)</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Filtered to specific Part</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/70">
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500"></span> Legendary
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Possible (~14.5%)</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">34.0%</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">57.9%</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Filtered to specific Part</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/70">
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span> Mythical
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Possible (~5.0%)</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">22.1%</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">37.7%</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Filtered to specific Part</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/70 bg-amber-50/30 font-bold">
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-950 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-600"></span> Pinnacle
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-emerald-800">~0.5%</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-emerald-800">1.5%</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-emerald-800">4.4%</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-rose-700">5.0% (SP, TW, KC)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Calculator -->
    <div class="mb-14 scroll-mt-24" id="calculator">
      <ArrowCalculator client:load />
    </div>

    <!-- Mathematical Formulation & Pity Explanation -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">The Mathematics Behind Arrow Chances</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Roblox STAND OUT utilizes standard independent binomial trials for each arrow roll. The probability of obtaining <em>at least one</em> target drop across $n$ attempts is expressed by:
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-amber-300 font-mono text-center text-sm font-bold my-4">
          P(at least one success) = 1 - (1 - p)^n
        </div>

        <p>
          For example, when using a <strong>Lucky Arrow</strong> ($p = 0.015$ for Pinnacle):
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-2 font-mono">
          <li>1 Roll: 1 - (0.985)^1 = 1.50%</li>
          <li>10 Rolls: 1 - (0.985)^10 = 14.02%</li>
          <li>50 Rolls: 1 - (0.985)^50 = 53.16%</li>
          <li>100 Rolls: 1 - (0.985)^100 = 78.06%</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 font-medium">
          <strong>Important Disclaimers:</strong> STAND OUT has no hidden pity counter that guarantees a drop after $X$ failed rolls. Furthermore, 7 utility Stands (Super Fly, Rolling Stones, Cinderella, Burning Down the House, Catch the Rainbow, Strength, and Lyin' Eyes) are completely removed from the arrow pool until you finish Storyline Quest 10 to ensure a smooth progression experience.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
